WASI support for LLVM 21.1.8 (libraries only), for spikes/browser-codegen.
Based on YoWASP's "Conditionalize use of POSIX features missing on
WASI/WebAssembly." (Catherine <whitequark@whitequark.org>, commit 97196c8 of
https://github.com/YoWASP/llvm-project), rebased onto 21.1.8, plus <cstdlib>
in CrashRecoveryContext.cpp and no getrusage on WASI. A patch to LLVM:
Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, like LLVM.

